{% comment %}
  Pearl Pearl DIY — fullscreen Shopify Page template.

  Why: embedding with min-height:80vh leaves a white band under the H5 tab bar.
  Checkout (Cloudflare) also hangs if it stays inside a short iframe.

  Setup:
  1. Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Templates → Add a new template → page
  2. Name it e.g. "pearl-diy" and paste this file
  3. Create/open a Page, set Theme template → pearl-diy
  4. Replace IFRAME_SRC with your GitHub Pages URL (?embed=1)
{% endcomment %}
{% layout none %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <title>{{ page.title | default: shop.name }}</title>
    <style>
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        height: 100dvh;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #fff;
      }
      #pearl-diy-frame {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        height: 100dvh;
        border: 0;
        background: #fff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <iframe
      id="pearl-diy-frame"
      src="https://morningjet.github.io/pearl_agent_tw/?embed=1"
      title="Pearl Pearl DIY"
      allow="payment *"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
    ></iframe>
  </body>
</html>
